      "shots": [
        {
          "id": "S01",
          "narration_id": "N01",
          "text": "一九四八年冬天，东京在战后的寒夜里飘着雪。",
          "start": 0.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.214,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.0,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 3.89,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.79,
          "shot_fill_fraction": 0.958,
          "tempo_factor": 0.813,
          "speech_start": 0.03,
          "speech_end": 4.82,
          "characters": 19,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.8
        },
        {
          "id": "S02",
          "narration_id": "N01",
          "text": "帝国银行大堂灯火未熄，职员们仍在整理账目。",
          "start": 5.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.503,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.28,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.17,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.81,
          "shot_fill_fraction": 0.962,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0732,
          "speech_start": 5.03,
          "speech_end": 9.84,
          "characters": 19,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.8
        },
        {
          "id": "S03",
          "narration_id": "N02",
          "text": "门外，一个自称防疫官的男人递来名片，还自称叫山口二郎。",
          "start": 10.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.827,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 6.59,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 6.48,
          "spoken_seconds": 6.81,
          "shot_fill_fraction": 0.9729,
          "tempo_factor": 0.9523,
          "speech_start": 10.03,
          "speech_end": 16.84,
          "characters": 24,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.429
        },
        {
          "id": "S04",
          "narration_id": "N02",
          "text": "他声称附近发生痢疾疫情，奉命送来预防药，请众人立刻服下。",
          "start": 17.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.712,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.58,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.47,
          "spoken_seconds": 6.76,
          "shot_fill_fraction": 0.9657,
          "tempo_factor": 0.8064,
          "speech_start": 17.03,
          "speech_end": 23.79,
          "characters": 25,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.571
        },
        {
          "id": "S05",
          "narration_id": "N02",
          "text": "窗外，美军吉普车驶过废墟街道，忙碌的身影映进玻璃。",
          "start": 24.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.095,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.924,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.82,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.82,
          "shot_fill_fraction": 0.97,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0007,
          "speech_start": 24.03,
          "speech_end": 29.85,
          "characters": 22,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.667
        },
        {
          "id": "S06",
          "narration_id": "N02",
          "text": "他打开药箱，取出两瓶透明液体，解释要分两次服用。",
          "start": 30.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.712,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.51,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.4,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.79,
          "shot_fill_fraction": 0.958,
          "tempo_factor": 1.1278,
          "speech_start": 30.03,
          "speech_end": 34.82,
          "characters": 21,
          "target_chars_per_second": 4.2
        },
        {
          "id": "S07",
          "narration_id": "N03",
          "text": "十六名银行职员依次站成一排，每个人面前的桌上，都放着一只小杯。",
          "start": 35.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.827,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 6.58,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 6.47,
          "spoken_seconds": 6.8,
          "shot_fill_fraction": 0.9714,
          "tempo_factor": 0.9509,
          "speech_start": 35.03,
          "speech_end": 41.83,
          "characters": 28,
          "target_chars_per_second": 4.0
        },
        {
          "id": "S08",
          "narration_id": "N03",
          "text": "来人先举杯示范，职员们相互观望，最后还是照他说的喝下。",
          "start": 42.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 7.1,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 6.75,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 6.64,
          "spoken_seconds": 6.75,
          "shot_fill_fraction": 0.9643,
          "tempo_factor": 0.9754,
          "speech_start": 42.03,
          "speech_end": 48.78,
          "characters": 24,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.429
        },
        {
          "id": "S09",
          "narration_id": "N03",
          "text": "整座银行陷入沉静，职员们无声地等着秒针走过一分钟。",
          "start": 49.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.793,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.611,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.53,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.81,
          "shot_fill_fraction": 0.9683,
          "tempo_factor": 0.9478,
          "speech_start": 49.03,
          "speech_end": 54.84,
          "characters": 23,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.833
        },
        {
          "id": "S10",
          "narration_id": "N03",
          "text": "随后，第二种药水倒入杯中，职员再次服下。",
          "start": 55.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.027,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.8,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.69,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.81,
          "shot_fill_fraction": 0.962,
          "tempo_factor": 0.9756,
          "speech_start": 55.03,
          "speech_end": 59.84,
          "characters": 17,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.4
        },
        {
          "id": "S11",
          "narration_id": "N04",
          "text": "几分钟后，大堂传来杯子碎裂声，散落的算盘珠滚进柜台底下。",
          "start": 60.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.6,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 6.42,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 6.31,
          "spoken_seconds": 6.81,
          "shot_fill_fraction": 0.9729,
          "tempo_factor": 0.9277,
          "speech_start": 60.03,
          "speech_end": 66.84,
          "characters": 25,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.571
        },
        {
          "id": "S12",
          "narration_id": "N04",
          "text": "来人趁着混乱取走现金和支票，拎起药箱，从后门匆匆离开。",
          "start": 67.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.908,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 6.66,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 6.55,
          "spoken_seconds": 6.8,
          "shot_fill_fraction": 0.9714,
          "tempo_factor": 0.9624,
          "speech_start": 67.03,
          "speech_end": 73.83,
          "characters": 24,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.429
        },
        {
          "id": "S13",
          "narration_id": "N04",
          "text": "警车与救护车相继赶到，医护人员进入银行，街边围起人群。",
          "start": 74.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.223,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.97,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.86,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.8,
          "shot_fill_fraction": 0.9667,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0084,
          "speech_start": 74.03,
          "speech_end": 79.83,
          "characters": 24,
          "target_chars_per_second": 4.0
        },
        {
          "id": "S14",
          "narration_id": "N04",
          "text": "报社印刷机彻夜轰鸣，帝银案很快登上全国报纸头版。",
          "start": 80.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.793,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.51,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.4,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.76,
          "shot_fill_fraction": 0.952,
          "tempo_factor": 1.1324,
          "speech_start": 80.03,
          "speech_end": 84.79,
          "characters": 22,
          "target_chars_per_second": 4.4
        },
        {
          "id": "S15",
          "narration_id": "N05",
          "text": "调查人员后来发现，案发前，另外两家银行也遇到过相似的防疫说辞。",
          "start": 85.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 7.721,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 7.5,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 7.39,
          "spoken_seconds": 6.78,
          "shot_fill_fraction": 0.9686,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0924,
          "speech_start": 85.03,
          "speech_end": 91.81,
          "characters": 28,
          "target_chars_per_second": 4.0
        },
        {
          "id": "S16",
          "narration_id": "N05",
          "text": "安田银行的职员当时拒绝服药，那个男人只好转身离开现场。",
          "start": 92.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.223,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 6.07,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.96,
          "spoken_seconds": 6.8,
          "shot_fill_fraction": 0.9714,
          "tempo_factor": 0.8772,
          "speech_start": 92.03,
          "speech_end": 98.83,
          "characters": 25,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.571
        },
        {
          "id": "S17",
          "narration_id": "N05",
          "text": "侦查人员循线追查，一张名片，成为确认身份的重要线索。",
          "start": 99.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.41,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.11,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.0,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.78,
          "shot_fill_fraction": 0.9633,
          "tempo_factor": 0.8632,
          "speech_start": 99.03,
          "speech_end": 104.81,
          "characters": 23,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.833
        },
        {
          "id": "S18",
          "narration_id": "N05",
          "text": "名片属于松井蔚医生；他却称，自己并不认识这个来人。",
          "start": 105.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.946,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.89,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.78,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.77,
          "shot_fill_fraction": 0.954,
          "tempo_factor": 0.9939,
          "speech_start": 105.03,
          "speech_end": 109.8,
          "characters": 22,
          "target_chars_per_second": 4.4
        },
        {
          "id": "S19",
          "narration_id": "N06",
          "text": "警方沿着名片上的身份继续调查，线索逐渐指向远在北海道。",
          "start": 110.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.712,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.54,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.43,
          "spoken_seconds": 6.77,
          "shot_fill_fraction": 0.9671,
          "tempo_factor": 0.8006,
          "speech_start": 110.03,
          "speech_end": 116.8,
          "characters": 25,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.571
        },
        {
          "id": "S20",
          "narration_id": "N06",
          "text": "在北海道的小樽，警方最终找到一位画家，他名叫平泽贞通。",
          "start": 117.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 7.117,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 6.969,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 6.86,
          "spoken_seconds": 6.78,
          "shot_fill_fraction": 0.9686,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0126,
          "speech_start": 117.03,
          "speech_end": 123.81,
          "characters": 24,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.429
        },
        {
          "id": "S21",
          "narration_id": "N06",
          "text": "当时五十七岁的平泽正在画室作画，生活与银行相距遥远。",
          "start": 124.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.921,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.66,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.55,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.79,
          "shot_fill_fraction": 0.965,
          "tempo_factor": 0.9561,
          "speech_start": 124.03,
          "speech_end": 129.82,
          "characters": 24,
          "target_chars_per_second": 4.0
        },
        {
          "id": "S22",
          "narration_id": "N06",
          "text": "一九四八年八月二十一日，平泽在北海道被警方逮捕。",
          "start": 130.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.41,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.177,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.07,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.81,
          "shot_fill_fraction": 0.962,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0584,
          "speech_start": 130.03,
          "speech_end": 134.84,
          "characters": 22,
          "target_chars_per_second": 4.4
        },
        {
          "id": "S23",
          "narration_id": "N07",
          "text": "审讯记录留下他的认罪供述；后来，他对这份供述提出异议。",
          "start": 135.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 7.338,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 7.22,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 7.11,
          "spoken_seconds": 6.78,
          "shot_fill_fraction": 0.9686,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0501,
          "speech_start": 135.03,
          "speech_end": 141.81,
          "characters": 24,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.429
        },
        {
          "id": "S24",
          "narration_id": "N07",
          "text": "到了法庭，平泽翻供，称先前的供述是在压力之下被迫作出的。",
          "start": 142.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.095,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.76,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.65,
          "spoken_seconds": 6.75,
          "shot_fill_fraction": 0.9643,
          "tempo_factor": 0.8324,
          "speech_start": 142.03,
          "speech_end": 148.78,
          "characters": 25,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.571
        },
        {
          "id": "S25",
          "narration_id": "N07",
          "text": "法槌落下，判决没有平息争议，关于证据的质疑仍在。",
          "start": 149.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.503,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.33,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.22,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.77,
          "shot_fill_fraction": 0.9617,
          "tempo_factor": 0.9003,
          "speech_start": 149.03,
          "speech_end": 154.8,
          "characters": 21,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.5
        },
        {
          "id": "S26",
          "narration_id": "N08",
          "text": "一九五〇年，东京地方法院一审判处画家平泽贞通死刑。",
          "start": 155.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.223,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.93,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.82,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.74,
          "shot_fill_fraction": 0.9567,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0135,
          "speech_start": 155.03,
          "speech_end": 160.77,
          "characters": 22,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.667
        },
        {
          "id": "S27",
          "narration_id": "N08",
          "text": "不同目击者对嫌疑人的辨认结果并不一致，案件因此留下诸多疑点。",
          "start": 161.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.304,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 6.11,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 6.0,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.81,
          "shot_fill_fraction": 0.9683,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0321,
          "speech_start": 161.03,
          "speech_end": 166.84,
          "characters": 28,
          "target_chars_per_second": 4.667
        },
        {
          "id": "S28",
          "narration_id": "N08",
          "text": "关于731部队涉案，至今仍只是未经证实的传闻。",
          "start": 167.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.793,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.54,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.43,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.78,
          "shot_fill_fraction": 0.956,
          "tempo_factor": 1.1339,
          "speech_start": 167.03,
          "speech_end": 171.81,
          "characters": 21,
          "target_chars_per_second": 4.2
        },
        {
          "id": "S29",
          "narration_id": "N09",
          "text": "死刑未执行，平泽喊冤近四十年，直到一九八七年病逝狱中——真凶是谁？",
          "start": 172.0,
          "duration": 8.0,
          "source_seconds": 7.21,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 6.97,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 6.86,
          "spoken_seconds": 6.89,
          "shot_fill_fraction": 0.8612,
          "tempo_factor": 0.9957,
          "speech_start": 172.03,
          "speech_end": 178.92,
          "characters": 28,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.5
        }
      ],
